# What the relay serverless function needs: api/index.py, vercel.json,
# requirements.txt, and src/sound_vault/. Everything else is desktop-app baggage.
#
# Git-triggered deploys never saw the heavy build outputs (they're gitignored), so this
# only bit a CLI `vercel --prod`, which uploads the working tree and died on "File size
# limit exceeded (100 MB)" — dist/ alone is ~1.9 GB. Keep this list ahead of that.

# Desktop build outputs and packaging inputs (GBs of .app / .dmg / binaries)
dist/
build/
packaging/
*.dmg
*.zip

# Not used by the relay
node_modules/
tests/
docs/
analysis/
_archived-branches/
scripts/
.claude/

# Installing this would try to build the whole desktop app
pyproject.toml
uv.lock

# Local caches / artefacts
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.pyc
